      "description": "Watch RB Leipzig vs Borussia M'gladbach highlights and goals from Bundesliga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The stage was perfectly set for a high-stakes Bundesliga encounter, with both sides looking to dictate play on the pitch on August 29, 2026. Setting the pace RB Leipzig imposed their will early on, constantly testing the Borussia Mönchengladbach backline. Their persistence paid off in the 26th minute when Ridle Baku fired a clinical left-footed strike home, capitalizing on an assist from Tidiam Gomis . This breakthrough provided the hosts with the momentum they needed to control the rhythm of the game throughout the first half. Expanding the lead The second half saw the hosts remain relentless. Just four minutes after the restart, Antonio Nusa doubled the advantage to 2-0 with a composed right-footed finish, again assisted by Gomis . The dominance reached its peak in the 66th minute as Rocco Reitz found the back of the net following a well-placed pass from Christopher Nkunku , effectively putting the result beyond doubt. Late VAR drama Despite the clear deficit, the visitors pushed for a consolation goal deep into stoppage time. Hugo Bolin appeared to have scored in the 95th minute, but the tension peaked as the referee consulted VAR . Ultimately, the goal was ruled out for offside, ensuring that RB Leipzig walked away with a clean sheet and a comprehensive victory in a match they dictated from start to finish."
